## Photography System

The photography system is the core research contribution of this project. Every captured photo is passed through an analysis pipeline that computes several aesthetic metrics:

| Metric | Description |
|---|---|
| **Saturation** | Measures colour vibrancy across the image |
| **Contrast** | RMS contrast — the spread of luminance values |
| **Symmetry** | Bilateral symmetry detection |
| **Colour Dominance** | Identifies the dominant hue in the scene |
| **Balance** | Compositional weight distribution across the frame |

All scores are normalised to a **0–10 scale** and displayed alongside the photo in the gallery.

