## Technical Architecture

```
Assets/scripts/
├── Generation/
│   ├── MapGenerator.cs       # Chunk generation, biome assignment, tree placement
│   ├── EndlessTerrain.cs     # Infinite terrain streaming and LOD management
│   ├── MeshGenerator.cs      # Height map → 3D mesh conversion
│   ├── Noise.cs              # Perlin noise utilities
│   └── TextureGenerator.cs   # Colour map generation
│
├── photoMode/
│   ├── PhotoModeController.cs  # Camera input and UI management
│   ├── PhotoAnalyser.cs        # Aesthetic metric computation
│   ├── PhotoScoreManager.cs    # Score aggregation
│   └── PhotoDatabaseManager.cs # Photo storage and retrieval
│
├── environment/
│   ├── BirdSpawner.cs        # Wildlife spawning
│   ├── DayNightCycle.cs      # Sun/moon and time-of-day
│   └── PlayerSpawner.cs      # Player initialisation
│
├── ScriptableObjects/
│   ├── MapConfig.cs          # Per-biome configuration (textures, audio, wind, etc.)
│   ├── NoisePreset.cs        # Noise generation parameters
│   ├── BiomePreset.cs        # Height regions and colours
│   └── TreeConfig.cs         # Vegetation spawn rules
│
└── MainMenuScripts/
    ├── mainMenuNav.cs        # Menu navigation and biome selection
    └── PauseManager.cs       # In-game pause control
```

### Performance Highlights
- Terrain and mesh generation run on background threads
- GPU instancing for vegetation (1023 trees per draw call)
- LOD system reduces polygon count at distance
- Physics colliders disabled beyond close range
- Chunk updates triggered only on meaningful player movement

